<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU buys Czech consumer magazine publisher.</title>
<headline>VNU buys Czech consumer magazine publisher.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Friday its Czech subsidiary Mona had acquired Czech publisher Ring A.S.</p>
<p>Prague-based Ring publishes a weekly general interest magazine with the same name with paid circulation of about 80,000 copies. The acquisition involves 19 people, VNU said.</p>
<p>The Dutch group said Ring fitted very well with Mona's activities and added the takeover was in line with its strategy to expand in consumer magazines in Central Europe.</p>
